# MC-X-F1, the register: judging the link of r1 to probe[2026-03] tests probe's `when`, which counts adv_pay[2026-03],
# planned before the cut and fulfilled by nothing. The balance that counts r1 lists it: "The list is transitive:
# whatever its evaluation read, through any chain (N-713), each `when` it tested" (L §8.2); "A link reads only what it
# names: the existence of the instance, by its keys, `where` and `when`" (L §5.19). f judges the link first; q lists
# the entry all the same (E §9 invariant 5: an answer doesn't depend on what else the run asks).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-19
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input adv: money PLN
input fee: money PLN
input adv_dom: int
input probe_dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place us: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move adv_pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, adv_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from other to us amount adv

move probe[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, probe_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  when flows(adv_pay[m], m) > fee
  leg cash from konto to us amount fee

ask f: flows(probe[2026-03], 2026-03)
ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  adv = 100.00 PLN "own"
  fee = 10.00 PLN "own"
  adv_dom = 20 "own"
  probe_dom = 25 "own"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[other] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version stmt
  cite bank
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-03-25, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to us amount 12.00 PLN, fulfils: probe[2026-03]) "line 1"
=== expect f q
f: 12.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: adv_pay[2026-03]
  cut 2026-10-19
q: 968.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: adv_pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: adv_pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: adv_pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: probe[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: probe[2026-02]
  cut 2026-10-19
